  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ。以前この国で猛威を振るった魔物なの。\n幾度か戦って、南海へ追い出したという話だけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Very. It once terrorized this land. They fought it several times before finally driving it into the southern seas."
